			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3285c700-c781-50de-80df-120ad21e1c28")
	)
	(text "3V3 PWR_FLAG represents the regulator output on the XIAO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18 145 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "34e878dd-3f15-51be-9295-d32503d853a6")
	)
	(text "10. PRESSURE ADC - optional ADS1115, J10 = screen_sensors J3 order"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.7 1.7)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "55fffef9-cd5d-40ae-82ad-202aeaeb5525")
	)
	(text "U10 LMR33630A, 400 kHz: 5.02 V with R28/R29 (100k / 24.9k). EN divider R30/R31 (100k / 7.15k):\nstarts at 18.4 V, stops at 16.9 V. +5V feeds J1 (screen), CAN, FLOW and the boiler SSR output.\nThe XIAO 5V pin is VBUS of its USB-C, with no diode: never plug USB into the XIAO on this board.\nUSB would drive +5V and, through the buck high-side body diode, the 24 V rail. Flash it off the board.\nXIAO 3V3 supplies CAN VIO, I2C, TMP102, ADS1115, FLOW pull-up, the valve driver\nand the PUMP_TACHO pull-up. USB-C, LDO, BOOT and RESET are on the removable XIAO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18 90 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "81c4f18c-3224-5f82-9e15-36f21e8f3e43")
	)
	(text "FUTURE PCB FIRMWARE: BOILER GPIO4, active HIGH (MOSFET driver).\nPreload LOW before output enable; disable heater pull-up.\nCurrent HW-399 firmware uses GPIO3, active LOW: do not use unchanged.\nOther existing XIAO pins retained; add status LED on GPIO2.\nFirmware unchanged; PCB placement and routing pending."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180 250 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "899e9430-72fc-5f6f-a9b8-39cc2e408b58")
	)
	(text "J11/J12: female 1x7 sockets soldered by JLCPCB (THT); the XIAO (U7) plugs in by hand\nand is not on the board. J11 pin n = XIAO pin n; J12 pin n = XIAO pin n+7."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 240 182 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ae53d971-b5e3-4b74-81c9-a098549d6aee")
	)
	(text "Seeed numbering: 1..7 = D0..D6; 8..11 = D7..D10.\n12=3V3 OUT; 13=GND; 14=5V IN. Pins 15..25 are bottom pads, NC.\nD6/GPIO43 unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180 130 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ec393e3a-b8d6-5eb2-8d0a-1e280d377c08")
	)
	(text "U6 ADS1115 on the shared I2C bus, ADDR tied to 3V3: 0x49 (TMP102 already uses 0x48).\nA0 reads the local 3V3; A1 reads pressure through R26/C14 (1k / 10uF, 16 Hz, 10 ms).\nA2, A3 and ALERT/RDY unused. J10 pin order matches screen_sensors J3: same cable.\nXDB401 output 0.4-2.4V on 3V3 supply, not ratiometric: use the absolute A1 voltage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300 128 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fa520c51-fb24-4f11-ad18-245705e08410")
	)
	(text "H1, H2, H3: M2.5 mounting holes, 2.7mm NPTH, not connected.\nH2 sits on the mains side: nylon screw and standoff,\nat least 5 mm tall."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320 245 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "feb8ff5f-2a57-5bac-946f-4e0df22231ab")
	)
	(text "2. XIAO ESP32-S3 - two female 1x7 sockets, 2.54mm pitch"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.7 1.7)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ff6ec07e-79e8-5c14-abb2-2e203fc3ede1")
	)
